  dollarsPerPoint: 5
  introText: "AUGUST, 2027. SANTA TERESA PORT OF ENTRY.\n\nThe crossing is hiring.
    Your cousin Jos\xE9 works security there, and he vouched for you.\n\nRent is
    due every night. It's that kind of apartment. Abuela's medicine is not cheap.
    Your nephew has outgrown his shoes.\n\nYour older brother Memo was sent back
    across eight years ago. Abuela still thinks he's in Houston.\n\nReport to Booth
    3 at 07:00."
